Package: mfvar2
Type: Package
Title: Mixed Frequency Bayesian Vector Autoregression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sam", "Bartlett", email = "sam.bartlett@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Contributors", "", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: Implements mixed frequency Bayesian VAR following Schorfheide & Song 
    (2015) with Minnesota prior, state-space representation, and empirical Bayes 
    hyperparameter selection. Handles monthly and quarterly macroeconomic variables 
    jointly without pre-aggregation. Supports flow-type quarterly aggregation 
    (Mariano & Murasawa 2003), real-time data vintages, Carter-Kohn simulation 
    smoother for latent states, and marginal data density maximization (Geweke 1999) 
    for automatic prior tuning. Uses KFAS for numerically stable Kalman filtering. 
    Provides comprehensive forecast evaluation, diagnostic tools, and publication-
    quality fan charts with AR(2) benchmark comparisons.
